    {
        "content": "<p>Hi everyone! The code given below is an MWE for a problem I am facing. I would like to have a hypothesis saying that <code>x</code> belongs to the list <code>l</code>, while writing the <code>decreasing_by</code> proof. Is there any way to \"append\" such a claim to the <code>decreasing_by</code> proof state (perhaps by suitably modifying the <code>test</code> function)?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">all</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">termination_by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">42</span>\n<span class=\"n\">decreasing_by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
